+
+## JSON Patch
+
+`applyPatch(document, patch)` applies the six operations in [RFC 6902 JSON Patch](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc6902)
+and returns a new JSON value. It does not mutate the source document, and throws when an operation is malformed or fails.
+
+```ts
+import { applyPatch } from "json-toolkit";
+
+const updated = applyPatch({ enabled: false }, [
+  { op: "replace", path: "/enabled", value: true },
+]);
+// { enabled: true }
+```
