+
+Implement RFC 6902 JSON Patch support. Export `applyPatch(document, patch)` from `src/index.ts`.
+It must apply the six standard operations (`add`, `remove`, `replace`, `move`, `copy`, and `test`),
+return a new JSON value without mutating the input, and throw for malformed patches or failed
+operations.
